{"questionId":"u02-s007-v001","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-factors-apps","skillId":"fraction-lcm-application","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"甲鐘每 4 分鐘響一次，乙鐘每 6 分鐘響一次。現在同時響，幾分鐘後第一次再同時響？","choices":["12 分鐘","10 分鐘","18 分鐘","24 分鐘"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"依題意逐步處理：再次同時響的時間是4與6的最小公倍數；lcm(4,6)=12。所以答案是「12 分鐘」。","steps":["再次同時響的時間是4與6的最小公倍數","lcm(4,6)=12"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"12 分鐘","truth":true,"reason":"12是最早共同時刻。"},{"choice":"10 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"10不是4或6共同倍數。"},{"choice":"18 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"18不是4的倍數。"},{"choice":"24 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"24較晚。"}],"commonMistake":"只把兩個週期相加。","concept":"同步時間是週期的 LCM。","tags":["數與量","最小公倍數應用","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-gcd-application"],"authoringIntent":"辨認雙週期同步。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"70e47db381b169db94f15093ca0ed4fd6cd12d23ef4e47677acf1310aef64e09"}
